WEBVTT

00:17:59.514 --> 00:18:03.109
you just watch your bad cats.

00:18:03.109 --> 00:18:06.012
Don't let them hook [up] with the Chinese cats.

00:18:06.012 --> 00:18:08.853
Only in this way, in the future,

00:18:08.853 --> 00:18:12.101
we will achieve the dreams of the mouse:

00:18:12.101 --> 00:18:16.077
that we can tweet anytime, anywhere, without fear.

00:18:16.077 --> 00:18:23.436
(Applause)

00:18:23.436 --> 00:18:25.121
Thank you.

00:18:25.121 --> 00:18:29.469
(Applause)